# CubalC self-evolve gen=148974 — braincube solves · algocube optimizes (pure C emitter)
SHARE state_matrix_only
BUDGET 40
GENESIS "NEXUS_COORD v1 | from=cubalc_evolve | type=self_evolve | gen=148974 | E=24793296 | face=2 | diff=4.00 | fit=0.962 | hold_flash=1 | algocube=1 |"

CUBE brain ROLE braincube PROTON 1
CUBE algo  ROLE algocube  PROTON 1
CUBE meta  ROLE meta      PROTON 1
CUBE hive  ROLE nanobot_hive PROTON 1
CUBE create ROLE construct PROTON 1
CUBE destroy ROLE deconstruct PROTON 0
CUBE a ROLE peer PROTON 1
CUBE b ROLE peer PROTON 1

PLUG brain algo
PLUG algo meta
PLUG meta hive
PLUG create destroy
PLUG brain hive
PLUG a b

FOLDBITS algo "1010101011111001001110011010101110111111011110001111110010111011"
FOLDBITS brain "1110000111000100110001110101000011011111001110101101000000011001"
FOLDBITS a "1010101011111001001110011010101110111111011110001111110010111011"
FOLDBITS b "1010101011111001001110011010101110111111011110001111110010111011"

SETDIGIT algo 8
SETDIGIT brain 4

IMPULSE create 1
IMPULSE hive 1
IMPULSE brain 1
FLOW 4

COMPARE a b
DECIDE algo
DECIDE brain
HARMONY hive

ASSERT CUBES >= 6
ASSERT DECIDE >= 0
ASSERT DECIDE <= 9
ASSERT HARMONY >= 0
